    "description": "<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Groom_Lake\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Groom Lake\">Groom Lake</a> and  <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Papoose_Lake\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Papoose Lake\">Papoose Lake</a>, both in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Nevada_Test_and_Training_Range\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Nevada Test and Training Range\">Nevada Test and Training Range</a>. Groom Lake is also in <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Area_51\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:Area 51\">Area 51</a>. Note that some of the lines you see beside Groom lake are among the longest runways on Earth.",
